OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 27 MAR
OL,4,G0000FRomesh Ranganathan: For the Love
OL,5,     Fof Hip Hop
OL,6,     GRomesh is joined by Kae Tempest,
OL,7,     Ga poet, rapper and playwright
OL,8,     Gfrom London. They share three
OL,9,     Gsongs that have shaped their
OL,10,     Gjourney so far, plus a pick from
OL,11,     Gtheir latest album.
OL,12,G0100FTony Blackburn's Sounds of Soul
OL,13,     GTony spins super Soul music and
OL,14,     Gcelebrates 60 years of Percy
OL,15,     GSledge's 'When A Man Loves A
OL,16,     GWoman', plus 50 years of Shalamar
OL,17,     Gand music from Thelma Jones,
OL,18,     GOlivia Dean and Bruno Mars.
OL,19,G0200FPick of the Pops
OL,20,     GMark Goodier counts down the
OL,21,     Gchart from this day in 1983.
